      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Other charges represent ancillary services which may include scheduling, system control and dispatch. Additionally, these charges may include reactive supply and voltage control from generation source services as well as refunds for prior period reconciliation.</xhtml:p>
